      "definition": "Of or relating to Thebes, the great religious capital of Upper Egypt on the Nile near modern Luxor. The Theban region was dominated by the temple of Amun at Karnak and its powerful priesthood, which by this era operated almost as an independent state and became the prize the Kushite kings courted on their way to ruling Egypt."
